  "raw_text": "```json\n{\"changes\":[{\"path\":\"python_programs/next_palindrome.py\",\"new_content\":\"def next_palindrome(digit_list):\\n    n = len(digit_list)\\n    # Find the next palindrome strictly greater than the current one.\\n    # Compare the mirrored (left half reflected) value against the original.\\n    left = digit_list[:(n + 1) // 2]\\n    mirrored = left + left[:n // 2][::-1]\\n    if mirrored > digit_list:\\n        # Mirroring the left half already yields a strictly larger palindrome.\\n        digit_list[:] = mirrored\\n        return digit_list\\n    # Otherwise increment the left half (with carry) and mirror it.\\n    i = (n + 1) // 2 - 1\\n    while i >= 0 and left[i] == 9:\\n        left[i] = 0\\n        i -= 1\\n    if i < 0:\\n        # All digits were 9 -> number grows by one digit: 1 0...0 1\\n        return [1] + [0] * (n - 1) + [1]\\n    left[i] += 1\\n    mirrored = left + left[:n // 2][::-1]\\n    digit_list[:] = mirrored\\n    return digit_list\\n\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nFinds the next palindromic integer when given the current integer\\nIntegers are stored as arrays of base 10 digits from most significant to least significant\\n\\nInput:\\n    digit_list: An array representing the current palindrome\\n\\nOutput:\\n    An array which represents the next palindrome\\n\\nPreconditions:\\n    The initial input array represents a palindrome\\n\\nExample\\n    >>> next_palindrome([1,4,9,4,1])\\n    [1,5,0,5,1]\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"\\n\"}],\"explanation\":\"原实现从中间向左扫描，遇到首个 <9 的左半位即进位并清零内层，但没有先比较“镜像左半”是否已严格大于原数：当右半原本小于左半时可直接镜像得到最小更大回文，而等价位（回文本身镜像等于自身）才需要进位。修复为先构造镜像候选，若严格大于原数则直接采用；否则对左半带进位加一后重新镜像；全 9 时扩展为多一位的 1...1。这样覆盖奇偶长度、中间连续 9 进位等情形，保证结果是最小严格大于原回文的值且仍为回文。\",\"evidence_ids\":[\"test-development-2\"],\"knowledge_citations\":[\"knowledge-public_tasks\",\"knowledge-testing\"]}\n```",
